weapon quad_sg
  source      Quad_Shotgun.fbx (owner upload 2026-11-03): rigid named parts, NO animation. Open/extract frames AUTHORED
              from the measured hinge by quad_frames.py: pin FBX xy (41.845, -12.368) r 1.608 (circle fit, 40 verts);
              the frame's front tab ends at the pin centre between the barrel's lugs. Open 45 deg (a shell drawn out of
              the lower chambers clears the standing breech at ~42); extract 4.0 (shells only;
              the ejector rides the barrel). FBX->MD3 axes (x,-z,y), then shifted
              (12.4, 0, 9.7) so the grip palm lands on the shelf donors' palm at Scale 0.75. Lock (hinge2) rides the barrel
              as a top rib extension: owner to confirm.
